  "proof": "Package geometry/state/history regression tests, host event and isolated-search regression tests, an independent consumer build, the full deterministic gate, and normal simulator observation of the real extension verify the affected local behavior. Independent review must inspect both the extraction and this applicability assessment.",
  "rationale": "This extraction moves local typing state, geometry, rendering and host view slots into a source Swift package and renames the optional emoji product. It does not change semantic requests, prompt contracts, parser behavior, gateway transport, model selection or external dependencies. The consumer retains document editing, AI callbacks, permissions and App Group ownership. The injectable emoji storage key is explicitly set to the previous key by the consumer.",
